        "subtitle": "Superior Postural Support through Tilting Functionality",
        "secondary_description": "<p></p><p>The \"Equipro Difference\" is quantified by industrial-grade materials compared to standard boutique seating. While generic stools utilize low-density padding, Equipro uses high-resiliency foam and ultra-white, ultra-resistant leatherette designed for 15 to 20 years of professional life. Our industrial-grade steel bases are engineered for stability where standard alternatives often fail under daily professional load.</p>",
        "show_variant_selectors": true,
